# Line-ending policy: every text file is stored AND checked out with LF.
#
# This repository hash-verifies fixture files byte-exactly (world packs,
# the golden content pack) and the golden tests compare exporter output
# to committed bytes. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# text files to CRLF on disk, which breaks every byte-exact assertion —
# so eol=lf overrides autocrlf for all text files, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never diffed as text, never eol-converted.
*.png binary
